WEBVTT

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:22.330
This kind of incident is on the rise in Yokohama.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:24.620
We have a flasher on our hands.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:28.500
Flashing, the most despicable of crimes.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:30.250
That's right! A crime!

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:32.720
I couldn't agree more!

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.130
Ishinagare-san.

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:35.010
Aye!

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:39.600
Can you distribute fliers to the students to get them to be cautious?

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.430
Yes! Roger that!

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:51.860
A tasty-looking snail~

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:55.280
That's a slug. You can't eat those!

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:56.320
It's all slippery...

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:57.570
Let's eat it!

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:00.370
Let's wrap it up in paper and take it home!

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:02.790
Sher, what's that paper?

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:05.080
Ishinagare-san gave one to me!

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:08.420
Watch out for flashers...

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:10.250
What's a flasher?

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:13.380
F-Flas... what?

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:14.670
Dunno.

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:15.970
Do you know, Herc?

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:20.510
Um, well, they wear a coat...

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:21.560
A coat?

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:23.270
I-I can't tell you any more...

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:24.640
What do they do with a coat?

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:25.520
U-Um...

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:26.440
Well?

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:27.600
I can't say!

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:29.440
Someone dropped a coat!

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:31.650
I found a coat!

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:37.070
Perfect, Herc! If you can't tell us, wear that and demonstrate it to us!

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:39.070
Oh, good idea!

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:41.870
Demonstrate!

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:43.290
What does demonstrate mean?

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:45.290
Excellent...

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:46.790
Excellent!

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:49.460
Excellent, if I say so myself!

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:56.720
W-Wonderful!

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:58.930
Oh, so this is flashing?

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:01.390
Something like this...

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:04.600
A-And he's naked inside the coat...

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:08.810
H-He's naked...

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:10.810
Naked!

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:12.730
Hercule Barton!

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:16.570
She's the picture of innocence, but she was actually the flasher!?

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:18.990
Unforgivable! Unforgivable!

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:20.870
It's totally unforgivable!

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:23.370
Flashers are the enemies of women!

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:27.870
But why would they do that?

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:29.710
That's, um...

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:32.210
Because it's hot, obviously!

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:34.550
Unforgivable!

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:35.210
It's totally―

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:40.970
Flasher!

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:43.720
Flasher!!

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:51.020
F-Flash-cycle?

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:52.650
She's a flasher.

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:55.110
You're a flasher, right?

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:56.070
You're under arrest!

00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:57.360
Wait a sec!

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:00.150
Y'all wrong. I ain't no flasher!

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:01.950
See, lookie here!

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:03.490
Looks stuffy...

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:06.330
She's the flasher, but she's not naked.

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:09.910
Nope! I'm the female detective, Coron-chan!

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:15.840
I solved cases in thirty minutes back in Kansai Prefecture. I'm as good as the detective-sergeant there!

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:17.460
Oh, is that so?

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:19.260
Thirty minutes, huh?

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:21.130
'Sup?

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:22.180
U-Under...

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:23.970
Under?

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:24.850
Under...

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:27.390
Under!

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:32.560
What, they tryin' to say I'm wearin' proper clothes up top but nothin' below?

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:34.360
There ain't any way that'll be―

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:38.280
They're called "drawers!"

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.690
I'm not embarassed!

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:44.070
I'm from Osaka to do some detective research, y'know.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:48.240
But I heard there's a flasher on the loose in Yokohama.

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:49.160
Flasher!

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:55.080
I'm bein' mistaken as a flasher thanks to this coat.

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:57.210
So I want to get rid of him, y'know.

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:01.670
I'd need an assistant, so I came to Holmes Detective Academy.

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:04.510
Hey y'all, don't ya wanna become my assistants?

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:06.390
Y'all got nothing better to do, right?

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:10.350
Assistants? We're Milky Holmes!

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:11.520
We won't do anything like that!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:14.230
We're busy protecting the attic, you know.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.900
And we have to gather food every day!

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:18.860
I'm sorry.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:23.110
Oh, forgot to say.

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:24.660
If y'all become my assistants,

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.990
you get FREE FRIED STICKS!

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:30.410
I often hear I'm like an assistant!

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:32.660
I'm pretty much a pro assistant already!

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:34.250
I want fried sticks!

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:35.460
I'm sorry.

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:38.420
Alright, there ya go!

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:39.340
Nom!

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:43.090
Oh, and no double-dipping, now.

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:45.800
Sher.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:47.010
Are you okay?

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.970
Oh, and one more thing.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:53.220
You'll be callin' me Coron-sama from now on.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:55.440
Huh? Why would we do that?

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.980
We might have fallen far, but not far enough to call you that!

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:00.230
Why is there no double-dipping!?

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:01.400
No!

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:02.190
Coron-chan!

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:03.150
It's Coron-sama!

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:03.690
Coron-chan!

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:05.900
Don't call me Kokoro-chan!

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:08.160
No, it was Coron-chan!

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:08.990
Coron-sama for you!

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.370
Oh, really?

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:12.290
Herp derp.

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:14.660
We are Milky Holmes!

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:16.460
We will never call you that!

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:20.960
By the way, assistants get all-you-can-eat cabbage.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:26.050
Milky Holmes sets off as Coron-sama's assistants!

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:27.260
I won't dip twice!

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:31.430
Right. Now to call out my god!

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:39.480
Who's that?

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:42.400
Borrowing-a-<i>kit-ten</i>nouji!

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:47.530
Eh? What just happened?

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:48.450
It shone!

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:50.160
Is that the Toys of Resplendence?

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:52.030
It's the Toys of Insight.

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:54.200
Insight? Sparkling?

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:55.200
Something like that.

00:05:57.330 --> 00:06:00.000
You can't see the forest for the trees at Shinsaibashi Station!

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:06.550
Also called the Toys of Self-Quips.

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:09.890
So did you get an insight?

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:12.050
In accordance with my god...

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:13.890
Accordance? What?

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:17.020
I need to look through all of Detective Academy.

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:20.480
I-Is the culprit in the Academy grounds?

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:21.480
That's it!

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:22.360
Woah!

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:24.070
So what does that mean?

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:27.490
Children!

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:30.860
There's a flasher on the loose, kids!

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:33.740
From now on, you need to BE CAREFUL!

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:39.250
He smells.

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:41.130
Let's go!

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:45.050
This presence is...

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:54.140
You're a pervert, aren't you?

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:58.300
Right back at you! Just who can hold their own against my delicate nipples!?

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:01.770
What a battle!

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:03.730
Not bad, are ya?

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:04.940
Take this!

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:07.940
Yes!

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:09.280
One more time!

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:12.700
How's that? I dipped it twice. You lose!

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:15.160
Oh, delicious! Lick lick lick!

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:16.410
Wait a sec!

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:18.120
Don't waste your sauce!

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:19.410
Give it to me!

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:21.120
With fried sticks too!

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:28.880
Have you seen a flasher?

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:31.260
Huh? What's this little girl asking me?

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:33.930
Seriously? Must be a joke.

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:37.640
Hey! Can't you tell this is private property!? Get lost!

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:45.310
Mr. Flasher, I want to meet you~

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:47.900
Have you seen a flasher around lately?

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:51.490
Hey, gimme a fried stick.

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:53.910
Hell no. I'll give you one once you get results.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:54.950
C'mon!

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:56.830
You're not even doing anything.

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.160
Who cares about that?

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.950
Here, have this cabbage.

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:03.460
Asking people isn't getting us anywhere...

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:05.420
We'll never get any fried sticks at this rate.

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.290
Ah, Kokoro-chan!

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:09.000
Don't call me Poporo-chan!

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:16.760
The expo's been busy lately so we got a bomb disarming robot to help us out.

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:18.310
Is that so?

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:19.890
I am Poporo Mark II.

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:21.600
Let's get along well, Poporo-chan!

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:23.350
Don't call me Poporo-chan!

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:27.190
So you're looking for a flasher?

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:31.190
It's pretty rare to see Milky Holmes actually investigating something.

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:32.820
That's so rare, I lol'd.

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:36.910
But we'll never get fried sticks unless we catch the culprit!

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:38.120
Huh?

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:41.580
Hey, listen up, do you have any idea who it might be?

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:45.540
A pervert will do! That's right, a pervert is fine, too!

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:49.960
Well, if you say pervert, then the first person that comes to mind is...

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:50.920
Found it.

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:52.460
Did you mean Twenty?

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:53.510
I see!

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:58.100
But Stone River might have a side to him no one knows of.

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:00.600
Yeah, he does seem pretty asocial.

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:02.020
I see!

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:04.270
But Rat would also be fidgeting all day.

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:08.270
He's the type to go reading porn mags behind temples.

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:10.820
Wait a sec!

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:13.570
From what I can see, Arséne's the real pervert!

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:16.030
She could win the Hentai Academy Costume Design Award!

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:17.320
I see!

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:21.240
Phantom Thief Empire? More like the Pervert Thief Empire!

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:22.040
I agree.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:24.120
Right'o. Got it!

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:25.000
Coron-chan!

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:25.910
Coron-sama.

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:27.000
Coron-sama!

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.630
Don't take my spot!

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:29.920
Ain't no mistake.

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:32.590
The crook's got2b someone from that Pervert Thief Empire.

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:35.220
What's got2b?

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:36.430
A brand of shampoo.

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:37.590
Got2b has profitable stocks!?

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:38.550
No one said that.

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:40.930
They're the culprits, I can taste it.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:46.640
Great ideas at Tanimachi Kyuuchoume Station!

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:53.070
Coron-chan!

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:54.230
Coron-sama.

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:55.240
Coron-sama!

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:58.990
My god just told me some great stuff.

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:01.990
We're goin' right now.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:04.040
Let's go!!

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:06.250
Yes, Coron-sama!

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:07.960
Who's that person?

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:09.500
Dunno...

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:22.640
Twinkle twinkle little star~

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:24.060
It's quite quiet tonight.

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:30.190
I have obtained your dear treasure, the Isezakichou Blue Diamond.

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:32.020
Weird...

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:33.610
It's too quiet.

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:34.940
Strange.

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:36.610
The police aren't even coming.

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:39.780
What the hell are the police doing!?

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:48.210
Hello, is this the bomb disarmament department?

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:50.580
The robot we borrowed is going nuts―

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:52.580
Eh? This happens frequently?

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:54.590
And it failed to disarm bombs too?

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:56.130
Are you serious?

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:57.670
Not a bug. It just fails.

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:01.090
They blocked the door so we can't do our work today.

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:02.800
Oh my god!

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:06.850
I'm supposed to be everyone's shining star!

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:10.230
This is so easy, our skills are gonna rust.

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:11.810
Stop right there!

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:14.400
That voice... Milky Holmes!

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:23.910
Fl-a-sh-e-r!!

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:25.870
*stumped*

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:29.620
Arséne, Twenty, Stone River, and...

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:35.250
Racket-san, the flasher who goes behind temples looking at porn mags!

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:36.590
W-What the hell!?

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:39.090
I-I'm not Racket! I'm Rat! Rat!!

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:41.090
Hercule Barton...

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:43.430
She shows off that she's a flasher,

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.890
and now she thinks to falsely accuse our innocent Arséne-sama?

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:48.770
How dare you!

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:52.270
What exactly do you all...

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:53.900
Together...

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:56.360
We are...

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:00.280
The assistants of Coron-sama!

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:04.240
G-Gotta pick it up...

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:09.160
Good, good!

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:10.700
Time for the next plan.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:15.710
My god says that the flasher has a lot of pride in his appearance.

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:18.750
So he doesn't like people mimickin' him.

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:25.390
That means we can draw him out if we copy what he wears!

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:31.730
Sproing-oing!

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:32.980
Very well.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:36.560
Come at me, Milky Holmes.

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:39.400
Y-Yes!

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:41.490
We're going to do it!

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:43.150
We're going to show it!

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:45.450
Here! How's this!?

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:48.280
How should I answer that...

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:52.250
You all don't make the cut! You know <i>nothing</i>  about wearing coats!

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:55.040
What!? We're wearing them properly!

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:59.210
You all have your coats buttoned!

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:03.090
I wouldn't be able to show my beautiful self right away if I had one on like that!

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:05.800
Y-You're right!

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:13.100
I'm professional and beautiful, and use only the ripping wonders of Velcro to accomplish my needs! If I do that...!

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:15.730
Two seconds, and my coat's off! Oh yeah!

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:17.730
Pro Coat Consciousness!!

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.020
Oh no!

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:23.320
I was so naïve!

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:26.320
I was so concerned with just wearing the coat...

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:27.910
I was too conceited!

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:32.290
Goodbye to the flasher within me~

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:39.750
An eternally too-beautiful memory~

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:41.290
Cordelia-san!

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:42.630
Don't give up!

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:45.340
Bodacious!

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:46.550
Milky Holmes...

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:50.100
Enough of your nonsense!

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:02.230
Sher, didn't we promise not to wear anything under the coat!?

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:03.690
Yeah, that's unfair!

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:04.780
I'm sorry.

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:06.900
I thought my stomach would get cold!

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:07.820
More!

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:13.410
Nero, you aren't naked!

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:14.740
You aren't either!

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:16.960
Y-You three are so unfair...

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:21.170
Herc-san, you're seriously...?

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:22.670
N-Naked underneath?

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:25.800
Hercule Barton!

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:30.220
I'll prove right here and now that you're the real flasher!

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:33.220
Don't run away!

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:35.810
Herc-san!

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:36.680
Herc!

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:40.440
Not sure what's going on, but here I come!

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:41.900
Milky Holmes!

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:44.360
Fried stick?

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:46.570
Who's there!?

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:50.700
With the body of a girl and the mind of a prostitute!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:52.620
You better not underestimate me―

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:56.120
You're so cool, Coron-sama!

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:59.870
How does this look cool?

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:03.880
This is so unpleasant.

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:07.590
Remember this!

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:12.300
Noooo!

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:14.430
That's...

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:16.100
Arséne-sama!

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:17.180
A retreat, huh?

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:18.140
Damn.

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:21.350
Hercule Barton!

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:24.400
Your true colors, which are covered by your cute appearance...

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:26.570
I will expose them next time!

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:38.660
Where am I?

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:45.630
It's so chilling...

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:09.610
No!!

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:25.250
T-The flasher was Coron-sama!

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:34.720
I'm Po, a personality born within Coron to show off her true desires.

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:39.760
A personality born within Coron-sama to show off her true desires!?

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:42.230
I'd like that translated to Yokohaman, please!

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:48.820
Coron is wealthy, but her life is tough.

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:52.650
She wasn't allowed to show her true self.

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:54.820
So she hid it all the time.

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:57.530
So that's how it happened.

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:05.960
She hid and disliked that part of herself,
which was how I was born as a second personality.

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:10.960
So, Po-chan was the perverted narcissistic flasher?

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:16.050
Not exactly narcissistic, but the other two are true.

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:17.180
So you're admitting it?

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:20.970
I can't help it. I love being naked!

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:22.600
I love it!

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:26.600
It's bad to cause trouble for others, though.

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:30.940
Yeah. I know.

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:33.400
Turn me over to the police.

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:35.450
Po-chan!

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:39.570
Let's stop by somewhere first!

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:43.370
I'm naked!

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:45.040
Everyone's naked!

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:48.000
It's a nude paradise!!

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:52.460
I can come here by paying just a little bit of money...

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:55.170
I'm glad that you like it.

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:58.010
I never thought we would come to a public bath.

00:17:58.010 --> 00:18:01.050
Well, you're rich, so you can go anywhere!

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:03.260
Isn't it great, Po-san?

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:05.930
Yeah!

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:15.570
You can see through everything at Shitennouji-mae Yuhigaoka Station!

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:18.070
Po-san!

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:21.830
I see. So that's what happened.

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:24.990
There's a personality named Po-chan inside me.

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:26.700
And not just that.

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:28.500
I know now...

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.170
...the true identity of the flasher!

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:36.510
It's time for today's news.

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:42.680
G4 has captured the flasher that has been causing trouble as of late.

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:46.720
I... I can't bear it anymore...!

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:48.230
Look at me, Yokohama!

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:50.310
I will protect the peace of Yokohama!

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:52.230
They took all of the credit.

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:56.150
We didn't have to tell G4 about it, did we?

00:18:56.820 --> 00:19:05.540
It's fine. After doin' some investigations, I realized that I might not have been the culprit after all.

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:09.460
Sher, Po-chan was happy, right?

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:11.540
You let her know of a great place.

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:19.170
She said that it was great that she came to Yokohama and met all of you.

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:23.180
Coron-chan, bye-bye!

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:25.560
Bye-bye!

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:29.390
Drill the taste into those heads of yours!

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:30.980
We won't forget!

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:32.650
Come again, you hear!?

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:33.810
We'll be waiting!

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:34.860
Take care!

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:39.070
Bye-bye!

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:43.240
Oh, but you're still not allowed to double-dip!

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:47.740
Milky Holmes is really a weird bunch.

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:49.450
Who's the weirdest one?

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:51.290
The most beautiful one is, of course, me.

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:52.870
The strangest one is Hercule Barton.

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:55.000
I have never seen such a manic pervert!

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:56.710
You're pretty much a pervert yourself.

00:19:56.710 --> 00:19:58.670
H-How am I a pervert!?

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:01.340
I have something called "common sense!"

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:02.550
That's my evidence.

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:05.470
I'll follow Arséne-sama for a million years!

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:06.640
Isn't that being a pervert?

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:08.100
I don't understand him at all.

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:10.140
Next time: Weirdos on the Eno Express.

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:12.270
The culprit is undoubtedly Stone River!
